##安装Termux+Acode记录 _2026年9月16日_
#安装并配置tx(Termux)
0.从F-Droid下载并安装
..tx中安装node:
`apt update`
`pkg update && pkg upgrade -y`
`pkg install nodejs`
..执行`termux-setup-storage` /开启存储权限
..安装_axs(acodex_server) with gui_
`curl -sL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bajrangCoder/acode-plugin-acodex/main/installServer.sh | bash -s -- --gui`
	_failed: Connection refused_ /设置VPN后重试
*Termux支持最新版nodejs

#安装并配置ac(Acode)
0.从gh下载并安装
1.Settings:Pluggins安装_AcodeX_插件

#运行
1.tx运行`axs` /`axs::terminal: listening..127.0.0.1:8767`
2.ac右上角菜单打开Terminal /初次需等待安装
..等待无响应 气泡提示“Failed to start AXS server after multiple attempts”
	切换到tx 看到有记录 切换回ac看到成功
	设置tx:耗电管理:允许完全后台行为 /重试一次成功
..可运行`node`
起始路径在`data/com.termux/files`

#授权/授予权限
You can open the Draw Over Apps permission activity with `am start --user 0 -a android.settings.action.MANAGE_OVERLAY_PERMISSION -d "package:com.termux"` so that user can manually enable/disable permission toggle.✓

If you have root or adb access (android-tools package), then you can run appops set --user 0 com.termux SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW allow to grant it and appops set --user 0 com.termux SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW deny to revoke it automatically from background. Run appops get com.termux SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW to check current state.

#示例
*备忘小技巧:
路径中有空格时 除了用引号 还可以用斜杠转译
-node 'drawing/bezier curves.mjs'
-node drawing/bezier\ curves.mjs

-cd /storage/emulated/0
-cd /storage/emulated/0/a_a/gh/hmmuaa/blog/js/cheatsheets/regex
-cd /storage/emulated/0/a_a/gh/hmmuaa/blog/js/zh2md
-node /storage/emulated/0/a_a/gh/hmmuaa/blog/js/cheatsheets/literal,string,int,undefined,null.mjs
-node 5,一次返回一组多个结果.mjs

#坏结论
虽然可以运行
但似乎并不能完成在ac中选文件运行等功能
可能是因为我用的是旧版本ac
和直接在tx中输入命令没区别